  "title": "OpenBiome Foundation Announces New Board Leadership",
  "summary": "Today, the OpenBiome Foundation announced the unanimous election of its Board Leadership for a three-year term, effective immediately. The officers, representing a cross section of innovators – from the clinical, patient, technology and financial fields – will guide the Foundation in its mission to expand patient access to microbiome therapies and drive scientific discoveries that […]",
